{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Infernal Cleaner</strong></i> is a relaxing first-person cleaning simulation game. Except, you're tasked with cleaning blood and filth stains from demented hellscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself doomed to a life in perdition after making a deal with the devil Mephisto. With no other choice but to do the devil's bidding, it's your job to clean the dungeons covered with blood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/extras/CleaningGif2.gif?t=1748162873\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast blood specks off the ancient dungeon walls. Scrub grime off the the stairways to torture chambers. There's a type of hell here for everybody...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use demonic tools to clean layers of <strong>blood and grime</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual</strong> satisfying gameplay that can be played at your own pace.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn shillings to unlock powerful cleaning techniques in the skill tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Surreal </strong>hell environments from different time periods.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616920?t=1748162873","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/f3529e51e8e0d9c942cc2db6b0ed5050d56108aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748162873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616920/22fc16616db8d29e126e293adfd790bcc72736a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748162873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea